varstore-write = forbidden
firmware-setting-mutation = forbidden
physical-ASUS-current-option-speech = not-established
claim = success establishes that one native pre-OS UEFI execution reads the live current ONE_OF value, resolves the selected option text from live HII, derives the spoken graphemes from that text, and produces progressing native HDA DMA audio for those graphemes
claim = success does not establish physical ASUS M1603QA audio until the AMD-5800H-REAL gate executes on that machine
